### Experiment Reviewed: exp036 (f0-Conditioned AmpPredictor + Scheduled Sampling)

**Key Metrics:**
| Metric | exp035 | exp036 | Status |
|--------|--------|--------|--------|
| **Amp Corr** | **0.800** | **0.797** | ❌ Slight regression |
